OL,3,GNEWSAMurder accused tells court 'I'm
OL,4,Aterribly sorry' for zombie knife
OL,5,Akilling
OL,6,
OL,7,FA drug dealer accused of murdering a
OL,8,F17-year-old has told a court: "I'm
OL,9,Fterribly sorry. I didn't mean to kill
OL,10,Fhim."
OL,12,FGeorgie Mears, 19, of Thornhill,
OL,13,FCardiff, is accused of attacking
OL,14,FTristan Kerr with a 13.5cm (5.3in)
OL,15,Fzombie knife in February.
OL,17,FMears had gone to a property in
OL,18,FAbertridwr, Caerphilly county, to
OL,19,Fdeliver two #25 bags of ketamine to
OL,20,FKerr in February, Newport Crown Court
OL,21,Fheard.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
